## What Was Done

The entire website has been redesigned per `SymantumWeb.md` with a Dext-style modern B2B SaaS aesthetic.

### Design System (`src/index.css`)
- **Palette**: Deep navy `#0A192F` hero/footer + pure white sections + off-white `#F5F7FA` middle section + emerald `#10B981` accent throughout
- **Typography**: Inter (Google Fonts), tight letter-spacing on headings
- **Component classes**: `btn-primary`, `btn-ghost-dark`, `btn-ghost-light`, `feature-card`, `product-card`, `flow-card`, `advantage-card`, `icon-badge`, `section-eyebrow`
- **Animations**: `fadeUp` keyframe with delay helpers (`.delay-100` → `.delay-500`)
- **Backgrounds**: `.hero-bg` (navy + radial emerald glow), `.advantage-bg` (dark navy with emerald glow)

